1
00:00:00,130 --> 00:00:01,650
Hello, respected judges.

2
00:00:02,650 --> 00:00:05,850
We are Team ChainSentinel from Bangladesh.

3
00:00:06,430 --> 00:00:10,950
My name is MD Arif Shekh. My teammates are Meherab and Irin.

4
00:00:11,250 --> 00:00:14,000
We chose Topic F: Agent Wallet.

5
00:00:14,610 --> 00:00:21,150
Businesses need to pay bills on time, but full AI wallet access can risk their money.

6
00:00:21,850 --> 00:00:27,100
We built Mandate to pay approved bills while the owner keeps control.

7
00:00:27,510 --> 00:00:34,030
The owner sets limits. AI understands requests, and a contract checks each payment.

8
00:00:34,173 --> 00:00:36,483
Let us look at Rules & access.

9
00:00:36,653 --> 00:00:46,533
The maximum amount per bill is 250 MDT.

10
00:00:47,033 --> 00:00:51,383
MDT is the test token we created.

11
00:00:51,733 --> 00:00:56,433
The vault currently holds 650 MDT.

12
00:00:57,193 --> 00:01:00,700
The daily budget is 400 MDT, and the reserve is 300.

13
00:01:00,820 --> 00:01:03,567
I am sending the access grant to the wallet.

14
00:01:18,340 --> 00:01:19,600
The agent is active now.

15
00:01:19,790 --> 00:01:28,050
Now let us ask our AI: "Pay that one."

16
00:01:28,530 --> 00:01:33,950
This request is unclear, so the AI should ask for clarification.

17
00:01:34,010 --> 00:01:40,050
It needs to know which bill we want to pay.

18
00:01:40,240 --> 00:01:44,430
"Which bill would you like to pay? Please provide the bill ID."

19
00:01:44,603 --> 00:01:47,583
Now let us give a clear instruction:

20
00:01:49,243 --> 00:01:58,263
"Pay HOST-1002 only."

21
00:02:01,797 --> 00:02:04,433
Let us approve the bill first.

22
00:02:05,298 --> 00:02:06,308
Send to wallet.

23
00:02:09,738 --> 00:02:12,258
The wallet opens successfully.

24
00:02:12,479 --> 00:02:14,699
Let us confirm the approval transaction.

25
00:02:14,760 --> 00:02:17,000
It is approved. We can see it here.

26
00:02:17,420 --> 00:02:19,150
Now let us tell the AI:

27
00:02:19,300 --> 00:02:25,100
"Pay HOST-1002 only."

28
00:02:25,980 --> 00:02:26,967
Let us ask AI.

29
00:02:29,147 --> 00:02:31,667
Here, the app asks for permission.

30
00:02:40,767 --> 00:02:41,767
Nice.

31
00:02:41,867 --> 00:02:46,367
This is the new payment we just made.

32
00:02:46,567 --> 00:02:52,167
The website now shows Confirmed for the 75 MDT payment.

33
00:02:52,627 --> 00:02:56,067
The balance is 575 MDT.

34
00:02:56,107 --> 00:03:00,117
The transaction link shows its public record on Sepolia.

35
00:03:00,827 --> 00:03:06,017
The earlier 200 and 150 MDT payments are separate records.

36
00:03:06,287 --> 00:03:11,267
We can check each payment instead of relying only on an AI answer.

37
00:03:11,437 --> 00:03:14,117
Let us remove the agent access.

38
00:03:14,317 --> 00:03:18,117
This stops new payments without the required permission.

39
00:03:18,397 --> 00:03:20,517
We can do this from our panel.

40
00:03:20,693 --> 00:03:24,030
We need to revoke permission.

41
00:03:24,236 --> 00:03:26,866
I checked the action. Send to wallet.

42
00:03:27,047 --> 00:03:30,167
This is how we remove the agent permission.

43
00:03:32,767 --> 00:03:34,267
Let us wait for confirmation.

44
00:03:34,587 --> 00:03:35,417
It is confirmed.

45
00:03:35,787 --> 00:03:36,697
Thank you so much.

